specifically from the retire_capture_urb() debug print:

sound/usb/pcm.c:1336 [snd_usb_audio]retire_capture_urb =3Dp "frame %d=20
active: %d\n"

With handle_tx_event() debug enabled as requested, I reproduced the=20
issue again.

